# Copy to `.env.local` for local development (Vite loads *.local files in dev).
#
# Base URL of the Voiza backend API. Leave unset when running `npm run dev`
# (vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://localhost:4000 automatically) or set it
# explicitly when the backend lives elsewhere.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
